16:40:43 define w-child = l- vl~ ds uc~
16:40:43 decay t > w+ b, w+ > w+child w+child
16:40:43 decay t~ > w- b~, w- > w-child w-child
16:40:43 decay w+ > w+child w+child
16:40:43 decay w- > w-child w-child
16:40:43 
